<section class="wiki-page-hero"><div class="container"><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="breadcrumb"><a data-copy-en="Player Wiki" data-copy-zh="玩家 Wiki" href="../wiki.html">Player Wiki</a><span>/</span><span data-copy-en="Tower Defense Workshops and Permanent Upgrades" data-copy-zh="塔防工坊与永久升级">Tower Defense Workshops and Permanent Upgrades</span></nav>
<p class="eyebrow" data-copy-en="Game systems" data-copy-zh="游戏系统">Game systems</p>
<h1 data-copy-en="Tower Defense Workshops and Permanent Upgrades" data-copy-zh="塔防工坊与永久升级">Tower Defense Workshops and Permanent Upgrades</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Find each workshop, compare turret and barrier research, plan grenade upgrades, and improve shared defence facilities." data-copy-zh="找到各个工坊，比较炮塔和屏障研发，规划手榴弹升级，并查清要塞设施的强化入口与费用。">Find each workshop, compare turret and barrier research, plan grenade upgrades, and improve shared defence facilities.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-menus">Menus and availability</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-turrets">EPOM: turret research</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-control">AIMy / Tinker: four shared control tracks</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-barriers">Orchid: two independent tracks per barrier</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-grenades">EPOM: Grenade Workshop</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-facilities">Defenses, Propaganda and Field Medicine</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-decisions">Choosing the next purchase</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-menus">菜单位置与在场时间</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-turrets">EPOM：炮塔研发</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-control">AIMy／Tinker：四条共享控制研发</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-barriers">Orchid：屏障的两条独立升级</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-grenades">EPOM：手榴弹工坊</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-facilities">防御设施、宣传设施与战地医疗</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-decisions">怎么决定下一笔支出</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><p class="starter-reading-note" data-copy-en="Select a screenshot to enlarge it. Screens show example inventories and progress." data-copy-zh="点击截图可放大查看。图中的库存和进度仅为示例，请以自己的实际情况为准。">Select a screenshot to enlarge it. Screens show example inventories and progress.</p><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><div class="starter-lead"><p>Permanent TD improvements are spread across the fortress’s NPC menus. Reclamation materials and shared Army EXP pay for research; temporary battle Salvage, Ammo and Command cannot pay these bills.</p><ol><li>Process salvage through Reclamation Bay, then inspect shared Army EXP.</li><li>Choose a menu for the problem: EPOM for firepower, Orchid for barriers, AIMy for capacities.</li><li>Each purchase advances the selected track one level; the next battle launch reads the new setup.</li></ol></div>
<section id="en-menus"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Material_Recipes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Research_Costs"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Battle_Deployment_and_Starting_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Menus and availability</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">NPC and location</th><th scope="col">Current menu</th><th scope="col">Usual presence</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">EPOM · Engineering</th><td data-label="Current menu">Turret Workshop / Grenade Workshop</td><td data-label="Usual presence">06:00–22:00</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">AIMy · AIMy's Control</th><td data-label="Current menu">Fortress Control</td><td data-label="Usual presence">00:00–24:00</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Orchid · Reclamation Bay</th><td data-label="Current menu">Barrier Workshop</td><td data-label="Usual presence">06:00–24:00</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Tinker · Engineering</th><td data-label="Current menu">Fortress Hardware / Army Armor</td><td data-label="Usual presence">18:00–24:00</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Anthrax · Training Hall</th><td data-label="Current menu">Recruit Training / Anthrax • Training Efficiency</td><td data-label="Usual presence">08:00–18:00</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cid · Underground Modification Clinic</th><td data-label="Current menu">Fortress Defense</td><td data-label="Usual presence">When Cid is present at the Clinic</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The NPC must have reached that role through their route. Time alone does not replace Orchid’s Room to Reclaim, Tinker’s Engineering arrangement or Anthrax’s Training Hall route. AIMy’s Fortress Control and Tinker’s Fortress Hardware open the same four research tracks, not two stacking sets.</p><p>These research, armor, Efficiency and facility purchases cost no in-game time or money. Processing a Reclamation queue separately takes 60 minutes; see <a href="game-systems-reclamation-bay.html">Reclamation Bay</a> rather than treating processing as part of each purchase.</p></section>
<section id="en-turrets"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Turret_Improvements"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Turret_Designs"></span><h2>EPOM: turret research</h2><p>Eight turret designs each reach Level 10. Steamshot starts at Level 1; the other seven first require a one-time material unlock to Level 1, then follow the upgrade curve. Their initial unlocks charge no Army EXP.</p><details><summary>Initial unlock costs, deployment costs and roles</summary><p>Unlock-material order: Alloy / Circuitry / Reagents / Flux / Pristine Cores. Battle-cost order: Salvage / Ammo / Command. These are separate purchases.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Turret</th><th scope="col">Initial materials</th><th scope="col">One deployment</th><th scope="col">Role</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Steamshot</th><td data-label="Initial materials">0/0/0/0/0</td><td data-label="One deployment">40/25/12</td><td data-label="Role">General-purpose single-target fire.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Rotary Cannon</th><td data-label="Initial materials">160/120/40/40/3</td><td data-label="One deployment">50/45/12</td><td data-label="Role">Fast single-target suppression.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Rivet Driver</th><td data-label="Initial materials">220/80/40/20/4</td><td data-label="One deployment">50/32/14</td><td data-label="Role">20→65% penetration chance; one extra target, two from Level 6.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Plasma Lance</th><td data-label="Initial materials">180/220/60/140/10</td><td data-label="One deployment">55/45/18</td><td data-label="Role">30→75% penetration chance; extra targets 1 / 2 / 3 at Levels 1 / 5 / 10.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Chrono Projector</th><td data-label="Initial materials">80/200/80/160/8</td><td data-label="One deployment">50/30/20</td><td data-label="Role">Chains to 2→5 targets, with jump range 90→135 px.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Nanite Beacon</th><td data-label="Initial materials">80/160/120/80/6</td><td data-label="One deployment">45/20/20</td><td data-label="Role">Repairs the most damaged eligible structure in range every two battle seconds: 6→17 HP. No attacks or hero healing.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Rocket Battery</th><td data-label="Initial materials">200/180/160/160/12</td><td data-label="One deployment">65/55/22</td><td data-label="Role">Splash radius 85→130 px.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Scrap Catapult</th><td data-label="Initial materials">300/80/140/40/8</td><td data-label="One deployment">55/15/18</td><td data-label="Role">Splash radius 105→150 px.</td></tr></tbody></table></details><p>Each level adds 20% of base Power and 10 px range; accuracy advances toward 95% at Level 10. Design-specific penetration, chaining, repair or blast radius also improves. This research does not also grow health or base attack rate, and deployment prices stay fixed.</p><details><summary>All Level 2–10 prices by design</summary><details><summary>Steamshot</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Target level</th><th scope="col">Alloy</th><th scope="col">Circuitry</th><th scope="col">Reagents</th><th scope="col">Flux</th><th scope="col">Pristine Cores</th><th scope="col">Army EXP</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">2</th><td data-label="Alloy">36</td><td data-label="Circuitry">18</td><td data-label="Reagents">0</td><td data-label="Flux">6</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">0</td><td data-label="Army EXP">150</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">3</th><td data-label="Alloy">60</td><td data-label="Circuitry">30</td><td data-label="Reagents">0</td><td data-label="Flux">10</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">0</td><td data-label="Army EXP">300</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">4</th><td data-label="Alloy">96</td><td data-label="Circuitry">48</td><td data-label="Reagents">0</td><td data-label="Flux">16</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">2</td><td data-label="Army EXP">600</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">5</th><td data-label="Alloy">150</td><td data-label="Circuitry">75</td><td data-label="Reagents">0</td><td data-label="Flux">25</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">4</td><td data-label="Army EXP">1050</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">6</th><td data-label="Alloy">228</td><td data-label="Circuitry">114</td><td data-label="Reagents">0</td><td data-label="Flux">38</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">7</td><td data-label="Army EXP">1650</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">7</th><td data-label="Alloy">336</td><td data-label="Circuitry">168</td><td data-label="Reagents">0</td><td data-label="Flux">56</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">11</td><td data-label="Army EXP">2550</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">8</th><td data-label="Alloy">480</td><td data-label="Circuitry">240</td><td data-label="Reagents">0</td><td data-label="Flux">80</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">16</td><td data-label="Army EXP">3750</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">9</th><td data-label="Alloy">660</td><td data-label="Circuitry">330</td><td data-label="Reagents">0</td><td data-label="Flux">110</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">24</td><td data-label="Army EXP">5400</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">10</th><td data-label="Alloy">900</td><td data-label="Circuitry">450</td><td data-label="Reagents">0</td><td data-label="Flux">150</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">36</td><td data-label="Army EXP">7500</td></tr></tbody></table></details><details><summary>Rotary Cannon</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Target level</th><th scope="col">Alloy</th><th scope="col">Circuitry</th><th scope="col">Reagents</th><th scope="col">Flux</th><th scope="col">Pristine Cores</th><th scope="col">Army EXP</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">2</th><td data-label="Alloy">27</td><td data-label="Circuitry">20</td><td data-label="Reagents">7</td><td data-label="Flux">6</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">0</td><td data-label="Army EXP">150</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">3</th><td data-label="Alloy">45</td><td data-label="Circuitry">33</td><td data-label="Reagents">11</td><td data-label="Flux">11</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">0</td><td data-label="Army EXP">300</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">4</th><td data-label="Alloy">71</td><td data-label="Circuitry">53</td><td data-label="Reagents">18</td><td data-label="Flux">18</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">2</td><td data-label="Army EXP">600</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">5</th><td data-label="Alloy">111</td><td data-label="Circuitry">83</td><td data-label="Reagents">28</td><td data-label="Flux">28</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">4</td><td data-label="Army EXP">1050</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">6</th><td data-label="Alloy">169</td><td data-label="Circuitry">127</td><td data-label="Reagents">42</td><td data-label="Flux">42</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">7</td><td data-label="Army EXP">1650</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">7</th><td data-label="Alloy">249</td><td data-label="Circuitry">187</td><td data-label="Reagents">62</td><td data-label="Flux">62</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">11</td><td data-label="Army EXP">2550</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">8</th><td data-label="Alloy">355</td><td data-label="Circuitry">267</td><td data-label="Reagents">89</td><td data-label="Flux">89</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">16</td><td data-label="Army EXP">3750</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">9</th><td data-label="Alloy">489</td><td data-label="Circuitry">367</td><td data-label="Reagents">122</td><td data-label="Flux">122</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">24</td><td data-label="Army EXP">5400</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">10</th><td data-label="Alloy">667</td><td data-label="Circuitry">500</td><td data-label="Reagents">167</td><td data-label="Flux">166</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">36</td><td data-label="Army EXP">7500</td></tr></tbody></table></details><details><summary>Rivet Driver</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Target level</th><th scope="col">Alloy</th><th scope="col">Circuitry</th><th scope="col">Reagents</th><th scope="col">Flux</th><th scope="col">Pristine Cores</th><th scope="col">Army EXP</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">2</th><td data-label="Alloy">37</td><td data-label="Circuitry">13</td><td data-label="Reagents">7</td><td data-label="Flux">3</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">0</td><td data-label="Army EXP">150</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">3</th><td data-label="Alloy">61</td><td data-label="Circuitry">22</td><td data-label="Reagents">11</td><td data-label="Flux">6</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">0</td><td data-label="Army EXP">300</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">4</th><td data-label="Alloy">98</td><td data-label="Circuitry">35</td><td data-label="Reagents">18</td><td data-label="Flux">9</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">2</td><td data-label="Army EXP">600</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">5</th><td data-label="Alloy">153</td><td data-label="Circuitry">55</td><td data-label="Reagents">28</td><td data-label="Flux">14</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">4</td><td data-label="Army EXP">1050</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">6</th><td data-label="Alloy">232</td><td data-label="Circuitry">85</td><td data-label="Reagents">42</td><td data-label="Flux">21</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">7</td><td data-label="Army EXP">1650</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">7</th><td data-label="Alloy">342</td><td data-label="Circuitry">125</td><td data-label="Reagents">62</td><td data-label="Flux">31</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">11</td><td data-label="Army EXP">2550</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">8</th><td data-label="Alloy">489</td><td data-label="Circuitry">178</td><td data-label="Reagents">89</td><td data-label="Flux">44</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">16</td><td data-label="Army EXP">3750</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">9</th><td data-label="Alloy">672</td><td data-label="Circuitry">245</td><td data-label="Reagents">122</td><td data-label="Flux">61</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">24</td><td data-label="Army EXP">5400</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">10</th><td data-label="Alloy">917</td><td data-label="Circuitry">333</td><td data-label="Reagents">167</td><td d