d data-label="Army EXP">5625</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">9</th><td data-label="Alloy">825</td><td data-label="Circuitry">165</td><td data-label="Reagents">495</td><td data-label="Flux">165</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">24</td><td data-label="Army EXP">8100</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">10</th><td data-label="Alloy">1125</td><td data-label="Circuitry">225</td><td data-label="Reagents">675</td><td data-label="Flux">225</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">36</td><td data-label="Army EXP">11250</td></tr></tbody></table></details><details><summary>Turret Control</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Target level</th><th scope="col">Alloy</th><th scope="col">Circuitry</th><th scope="col">Reagents</th><th scope="col">Flux</th><th scope="col">Pristine Cores</th><th scope="col">Army EXP</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">2</th><td data-label="Alloy">18</td><td data-label="Circuitry">45</td><td data-label="Reagents">9</td><td data-label="Flux">18</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">0</td><td data-label="Army EXP">225</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">3</th><td data-label="Alloy">30</td><td data-label="Circuitry">75</td><td data-label="Reagents">15</td><td data-label="Flux">30</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">0</td><td data-label="Army EXP">450</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">4</th><td data-label="Alloy">48</td><td data-label="Circuitry">120</td><td data-label="Reagents">24</td><td data-label="Flux">48</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">2</td><td data-label="Army EXP">900</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">5</th><td data-label="Alloy">75</td><td data-label="Circuitry">188</td><td data-label="Reagents">37</td><td data-label="Flux">75</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">4</td><td data-label="Army EXP">1575</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">6</th><td data-label="Alloy">114</td><td data-label="Circuitry">285</td><td data-label="Reagents">57</td><td data-label="Flux">114</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">7</td><td data-label="Army EXP">2475</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">7</th><td data-label="Alloy">168</td><td data-label="Circuitry">420</td><td data-label="Reagents">84</td><td data-label="Flux">168</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">11</td><td data-label="Army EXP">3825</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">8</th><td data-label="Alloy">240</td><td data-label="Circuitry">600</td><td data-label="Reagents">120</td><td data-label="Flux">240</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">16</td><td data-label="Army EXP">5625</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">9</th><td data-label="Alloy">330</td><td data-label="Circuitry">825</td><td data-label="Reagents">165</td><td data-label="Flux">330</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">24</td><td data-label="Army EXP">8100</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">10</th><td data-label="Alloy">450</td><td data-label="Circuitry">1125</td><td data-label="Reagents">225</td><td data-label="Flux">450</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">36</td><td data-label="Army EXP">11250</td></tr></tbody></table></details></details><figure class="reviewed-screenshot"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: AIMy and Tinker share these four control tracks. Starting Lives, barrier supply, barrier Health and concurrent turret capacity have different effects." href="../assets/images/wiki/td-workshops-guide/en-control.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="AIMy and Tinker share these four control tracks. Starting Lives, barrier supply, barrier Health and concurrent turret capacity have different effects." decoding="async" height="720" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/td-workshops-guide/en-control.webp" width="1280"/></a><figcaption>AIMy and Tinker share these four control tracks. Starting Lives, barrier supply, barrier Health and concurrent turret capacity have different effects.</figcaption></figure></section>
<section id="en-barriers"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Hero-Dependent_Barriers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Regular_Barriers"></span><h2>Orchid: two independent tracks per barrier</h2><p>Each of the eight ordinary barriers has independent Level 1–10 stock/health and property tracks. Buying one does not raise the other. Base supply is six uses per design; AIMy raises that base, while Orchid adds one use per design level. The combined maximum is 33 uses for each design, not 33 shared uses.</p><p>Supply lasts the entire battle. Destruction and new waves normally do not refill it; Box recovery is a specific exception. Orchid adds 20% of base HP per level, multiplied by AIMy’s Structural Reinforcement, with rounding once at the end. Both at maximum give 6.58× base HP.</p><details><summary>Eight barriers: base values, prices and properties</summary><p>Battle prices are Salvage / Ammo / Command. Property arrows show Level 1→10 growth, with linear intermediate values.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Barrier</th><th scope="col">Base HP</th><th scope="col">Battle price</th><th scope="col">Property Level 1→10</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Barricade</th><td data-label="Base HP">180</td><td data-label="Battle price">20/0/3</td><td data-label="Property Level 1→10">Incoming melee hits have a 10→40% chance to stagger the attacker for 0.15→0.60 seconds, including the destroying hit.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Box</th><td data-label="Base HP">140</td><td data-label="Battle price">16/0/2</td><td data-label="Property Level 1→10">On destruction, 5→75% chance to restore one spent Box deployment. Placing its replacement still costs resources.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Wall</th><td data-label="Base HP">320</td><td data-label="Battle price">32/0/5</td><td data-label="Property Level 1→10">Reduces damage received by the Wall itself by 5→35%.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Sandbags</th><td data-label="Base HP">220</td><td data-label="Battle price">22/0/3</td><td data-label="Property Level 1→10">Reduces enemy ranged damage to heroes in a 100→150 px aura by 10→40%.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Rubble</th><td data-label="Base HP">100</td><td data-label="Battle price">12/0/1</td><td data-label="Property Level 1→10">Slows enemy movement by 10→40% in a 100→150 px aura.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Reinforced Box</th><td data-label="Base HP">280</td><td data-label="Battle price">30/0/4</td><td data-label="Property Level 1→10">Repairs itself for 1→5% maximum HP every five active battle seconds.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Arcane Scrap Ward</th><td data-label="Base HP">200</td><td data-label="Battle price">26/8/6</td><td data-label="Property Level 1→10">Reduces robotic enemies’ outgoing damage by 10→35% within 100→150 px.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Razor Scrap Barricade</th><td data-label="Base HP">210</td><td data-label="Battle price">28/10/5</td><td data-label="Property Level 1→10">Reflects 10→50% of an incoming melee hit’s pre-mitigation damage, including the destroying hit; reflected kills award Army EXP.</td></tr></tbody></table></details><p>Overlapping copies of the same aura use the strongest effect rather than adding percentages; different protections can combine. Nanite Beacon repairs turrets and barriers, Orchid repairs barriers, and Saline heals heroes. These roles are distinct.</p><details><summary>Complete costs for both tracks of each design</summary><p>The two tracks of a design use the same cost table but are purchased independently.</p><details><summary>Barricade</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Target level</th><th scope="col">Alloy</th><th scope="col">Circuitry</th><th scope="col">Reagents</th><th scope="col">Flux</th><th scope="col">Pristine Cores</th><th scope="col">Army EXP</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">2</th><td data-label="Alloy">84</td><td data-label="Circuitry">12</td><td data-label="Reagents">12</td><td data-label="Flux">12</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">0</td><td data-label="Army EXP">150</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">3</th><td data-label="Alloy">140</td><td data-label="Circuitry">20</td><td data-label="Reagents">20</td><td data-label="Flux">20</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">0</td><td data-label="Army EXP">300</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">4</th><td data-label="Alloy">224</td><td data-label="Circuitry">32</td><td data-label="Reagents">32</td><td data-label="Flux">32</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">4</td><td data-label="Army EXP">600</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">5</th><td data-label="Alloy">350</td><td data-label="Circuitry">50</td><td data-label="Reagents">50</td><td data-label="Flux">50</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">8</td><td data-label="Army EXP">1050</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">6</th><td data-label="Alloy">532</td><td data-label="Circuitry">76</td><td data-label="Reagents">76</td><td data-label="Flux">76</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">14</td><td data-label="Army EXP">1650</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">7</th><td data-label="Alloy">784</td><td data-label="Circuitry">112</td><td data-label="Reagents">112</td><td data-label="Flux">112</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">22</td><td data-label="Army EXP">2550</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">8</th><td data-label="Alloy">1120</td><td data-label="Circuitry">160</td><td data-label="Reagents">160</td><td data-label="Flux">160</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">32</td><td data-label="Army EXP">3750</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">9</th><td data-label="Alloy">1540</td><td data-label="Circuitry">220</td><td data-label="Reagents">220</td><td data-label="Flux">220</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">48</td><td data-label="Army EXP">5400</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">10</th><td data-label="Alloy">2100</td><td data-label="Circuitry">300</td><td data-label="Reagents">300</td><td data-label="Flux">300</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">72</td><td data-label="Army EXP">7500</td></tr></tbody></table></details><details><summary>Box</summary>