Cores">22</td><td data-label="Army EXP">2550</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">8</th><td data-label="Alloy">960</td><td data-label="Circuitry">320</td><td data-label="Reagents">160</td><td data-label="Flux">160</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">32</td><td data-label="Army EXP">3750</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">9</th><td data-label="Alloy">1320</td><td data-label="Circuitry">440</td><td data-label="Reagents">220</td><td data-label="Flux">220</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">48</td><td data-label="Army EXP">5400</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">10</th><td data-label="Alloy">1800</td><td data-label="Circuitry">600</td><td data-label="Reagents">300</td><td data-label="Flux">300</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">72</td><td data-label="Army EXP">7500</td></tr></tbody></table></details></details><details><summary>Tree and Kinetic Shield Gate exceptions</summary><p>Purchased Trees require a living deployed Terra; Kinetic Shield Gates require a living deployed Glitch. Each allows five active copies, paid in battle resources. They do not use the ordinary eight designs’ whole-battle supply or Orchid’s stock/property research. AIMy’s Structural Reinforcement still raises their HP.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Design</th><th scope="col">Base HP</th><th scope="col">Salvage / Ammo / Command</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Tree</th><td data-label="Base HP">240</td><td data-label="Salvage / Ammo / Command">24/0/4</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Kinetic Shield Gate</th><td data-label="Base HP">360</td><td data-label="Salvage / Ammo / Command">38/12/8</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Terra’s freely conjured special Trees have their own count limit and HP formula. They consume no purchased supply and do not receive either HP research multiplier.</p></details><figure class="reviewed-screenshot"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Each of Orchid’s eight barriers has separate durability and special-property tracks. Tree and Shield Gate are outside this workshop." href="../assets/images/wiki/td-workshops-guide/en-barriers.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Each of Orchid’s eight barriers has separate durability and special-property tracks. Tree and Shield Gate are outside this workshop." decoding="async" height="720" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/td-workshops-guide/en-barriers.webp" width="1280"/></a><figcaption>Each of Orchid’s eight barriers has separate durability and special-property tracks. Tree and Shield Gate are outside this workshop.</figcaption></figure></section>
<section id="en-grenades"><h2>EPOM: Grenade Workshop</h2><p>Damage, blast radius and cooldown are three independent Level 1–10 tracks: damage 60→240 (+20 per level), radius 175→220 px (+5), and cooldown 30→12 seconds (−2). Radius is not diameter. Raising one does not raise the others.</p><p>An activated Fragmentation Kit adds 25 radius pixels. Resonance Amplifier adds 50% grenade damage, giving 360 at maximum damage research. Grenades cost no battle currency. Their cooldown uses active real seconds, carries across waves and does not accelerate with battle speed.</p><details><summary>Complete costs for all three grenade tracks</summary><details><summary>Damage</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Target level</th><th scope="col">Alloy</th><th scope="col">Circuitry</th><th scope="col">Reagents</th><th scope="col">Flux</th><th scope="col">Pristine Cores</th><th scope="col">Army EXP</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">2</th><td data-label="Alloy">30</td><td data-label="Circuitry">6</td><td data-label="Reagents">18</td><td data-label="Flux">6</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">0</td><td data-label="Army EXP">400</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">3</th><td data-label="Alloy">50</td><td data-label="Circuitry">10</td><td data-label="Reagents">30</td><td data-label="Flux">10</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">0</td><td data-label="Army EXP">800</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">4</th><td data-label="Alloy">80</td><td data-label="Circuitry">16</td><td data-label="Reagents">48</td><td data-label="Flux">16</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">2</td><td data-label="Army EXP">1600</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">5</th><td data-label="Alloy">125</td><td data-label="Circuitry">25</td><td data-label="Reagents">75</td><td data-label="Flux">25</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">4</td><td data-label="Army EXP">2800</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">6</th><td data-label="Alloy">190</td><td data-label="Circuitry">38</td><td data-label="Reagents">114</td><td data-label="Flux">38</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">7</td><td data-label="Army EXP">4400</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">7</th><td data-label="Alloy">280</td><td data-label="Circuitry">56</td><td data-label="Reagents">168</td><td data-label="Flux">56</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">11</td><td data-label="Army EXP">6800</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">8</th><td data-label="Alloy">400</td><td data-label="Circuitry">80</td><td data-label="Reagents">240</td><td data-label="Flux">80</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">16</td><td data-label="Army EXP">10000</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">9</th><td data-label="Alloy">550</td><td data-label="Circuitry">110</td><td data-label="Reagents">330</td><td data-label="Flux">110</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">24</td><td data-label="Army EXP">14400</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">10</th><td data-label="Alloy">750</td><td data-label="Circuitry">150</td><td data-label="Reagents">450</td><td data-label="Flux">150</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">36</td><td data-label="Army EXP">20000</td></tr></tbody></table></details><details><summary>Blast radius</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Target level</th><th scope="col">Alloy</th><th scope="col">Circuitry</th><th scope="col">Reagents</th><th scope="col">Flux</th><th scope="col">Pristine Cores</th><th scope="col">Army EXP</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">2</th><td data-label="Alloy">12</td><td data-label="Circuitry">6</td><td data-label="Reagents">24</td><td data-label="Flux">18</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">0</td><td data-label="Army EXP">400</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">3</th><td data-label="Alloy">20</td><td data-label="Circuitry">10</td><td data-label="Reagents">40</td><td data-label="Flux">30</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">0</td><td data-label="Army EXP">800</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">4</th><td data-label="Alloy">32</td><td data-label="Circuitry">16</td><td data-label="Reagents">64</td><td data-label="Flux">48</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">2</td><td data-label="Army EXP">1600<