</td><td data-label="Circuitry">50</td><td data-label="Reagents">10</td><td data-label="Flux">20</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">0</td><td data-label="Army EXP">800</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">4</th><td data-label="Alloy">32</td><td data-label="Circuitry">80</td><td data-label="Reagents">16</td><td data-label="Flux">32</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">2</td><td data-label="Army EXP">1600</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">5</th><td data-label="Alloy">50</td><td data-label="Circuitry">125</td><td data-label="Reagents">25</td><td data-label="Flux">50</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">4</td><td data-label="Army EXP">2800</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">6</th><td data-label="Alloy">76</td><td data-label="Circuitry">190</td><td data-label="Reagents">38</td><td data-label="Flux">76</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">7</td><td data-label="Army EXP">4400</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">7</th><td data-label="Alloy">112</td><td data-label="Circuitry">280</td><td data-label="Reagents">56</td><td data-label="Flux">112</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">11</td><td data-label="Army EXP">6800</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">8</th><td data-label="Alloy">160</td><td data-label="Circuitry">400</td><td data-label="Reagents">80</td><td data-label="Flux">160</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">16</td><td data-label="Army EXP">10000</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">9</th><td data-label="Alloy">220</td><td data-label="Circuitry">550</td><td data-label="Reagents">110</td><td data-label="Flux">220</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">24</td><td data-label="Army EXP">14400</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">10</th><td data-label="Alloy">300</td><td data-label="Circuitry">750</td><td data-label="Reagents">150</td><td data-label="Flux">300</td><td data-label="Pristine Cores">36</td><td data-label="Army EXP">20000</td></tr></tbody></table></details></details><figure class="reviewed-screenshot"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Grenade damage, blast radius and cooldown are separate permanent tracks. A material balance alone is insufficient when the Army EXP cost is still unmet." href="../assets/images/wiki/td-workshops-guide/en-grenades.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Grenade damage, blast radius and cooldown are separate permanent tracks. A material balance alone is insufficient when the Army EXP cost is still unmet." decoding="async" height="720" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/td-workshops-guide/en-grenades.webp" width="1280"/></a><figcaption>Grenade damage, blast radius and cooldown are separate permanent tracks. A material balance alone is insufficient when the Army EXP cost is still unmet.</figcaption></figure></section>
<section id="en-facilities"><h2>Defenses, Propaganda and Field Medicine</h2><p>These three facilities improve through NPC actions. Defenses and Propaganda begin at Level 1, Field Medicine at Level 0. The Barracks header shows their current levels.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Facility</th><th scope="col">Current improvement route</th><th scope="col">Battle effect</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Defenses</th><td data-label="Current improvement route">After Cid introduces Chronium, use his Clinic’s Fortress Defense purchase: 10 Chronium for +1 level, repeatable without a fixed cap.</td><td data-label="Battle effect">Turrets and barriers subtract Level − 1 flat damage per hit, potentially to zero. No hero or Lives protection.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Propaganda</th><td data-label="Current improvement route">Five NPCs each offer one free +1 lesson per run, requiring In Love, at least 3000 affection and their route prerequisites.</td><td data-label="Battle effect">Adds Level − 1 to hero damage after item percentage modifiers; no player-gun or turret damage.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Field Medicine</th><td data-label="Current improvement route">Akira, Amelia and Willow each offer one free lesson per run, requiring In Love and a manual action while present.</td><td data-label="Battle effect">Each level adds 1 HP to Rally Patch ticks, one percentage point of maximum HP to Field Med-Injector, and 1 HP plus 1 radius pixel to Saline’s special. It does not create global passive healing.</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Cid’s material-purchase menu is separate from launching the Fortress Defense battle. Chronium requires his introduction after Story Beat 65; it currently comes from eligible Infinite TD attempts. See <a href="game-systems-td-battle-reference.html">Battle Reference</a>.</p><details><summary>Three Field Medicine lessons: places, hours and action names</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">NPC</th><th scope="col">Location</th><th scope="col">Hours</th><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Extra condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Akira</th><td data-label="Location">Dr. Akira's Office</td><td data-label="Hours">06:00–19:00</td><td data-label="Action">The Part That Matters</td><td data-label="Extra condition">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Amelia</th><td data-label="Location">Village Healer's Hut</td><td data-label="Hours">06:00–21:00</td><td data-label="Action">The Care We Share</td><td data-label="Extra condition">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Willow</th><td data-label="Location">Nurse's Room</td><td data-label="Hours">09:00–16:00</td><td data-label="Action">What Care Can Become</td><td data-label="Extra condition">Willow must also be an active worker.</td></tr></tbody></table></details><details><summary>Five Propaganda lessons: full route prerequisites (late quest titles)</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">NPC</th><th scope="col">Location</th><th scope="col">Hours</th><th scope="col">Lesson</th><th scope="col">Also complete all of these</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Kuro</th><td data-label="Location">Mood Regulation Audio Broadcasting Center</td><td data-label="Hours">10:00–22:00</td><td data-label="Lesson">A Voice Through the Noise</td><td data-label="Also complete all of these">Constant Signal; Unmeasured Time; Private Time with Kuro; A Useful Resonance; The Carrier Window; Heart-to-heart: Constant Frequency</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Motley</th><td data-label="Location">Motley's Lair</td><td data-label="Hours">00:00–24:00</td><td data-label="Lesson">Give Them a Reason</td><td data-label="Also complete all of these">Complete Motley’s relevant personal revelation event, following current Objectives; Our War; Heart-to-heart: The Last Inch; Heart-to-heart: A Place to Return</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cressida</th><td data-label="Location">Operations Center</td><td data-label="Hours">08:00–22:00</td><td data-label="Lesson">A Promise Worth Signing</td><td data-label="Also complete all of these">The Exception Becomes Policy; Heart-to-heart: No Approval Required</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Liora</th><td data-label="Location">Sacred Anomaly Blessing Temple</td><td data-label="Hours">18:00–22:00</td><td data-label="Lesson">A Place in the Line</td><td data-label="Also complete all of these">What We Keep Sacred; Heart-to-heart: No Prophecy for This</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Zosia</th><td data-label="Location">Universal Knowledge Synthesis Institute</td><td data-label="Hours">09:00–19:00</td><td data-label="Lesson">A Claim Worth Repeating</td><td data-label="Also complete all of these">The Examination That Failed; Reserved for You; Heart-to-heart: For the Avoidance of Doubt</td></tr></tbody></table></details><p>Lessons cost no time, money or materials and do not spend affection. Each lesson is claimed once in an ordinary playthrough. New Game+ retains earned facility levels while character routes and lesson requirements must be followed again.</p><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 860px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: After Cid’s Chronium introduction, each ten-Chronium purchase adds one permanent Defense level with no upgrade-count limit. Balance shown is an example." href="../assets/images/wiki/td-workshops-guide/en-cid-defense-full.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="After Cid’s Chronium introduction, each ten-Chronium purchase adds one permanent Defense level with no upgrade-count limit. Balance shown is an example." decoding="async" height="560" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/td-workshops-guide/en-cid-defense.webp" width="860"/></a><figcaption>After Cid’s Chronium introduction, each ten-Chronium purchase adds one permanent Defense level with no upgrade-count limit. Balance shown is an example.</figcaption></figure></section>
<section id="en-decisions"><h2>Choosing the next purchase</h2><ul><li>Not enough turret slots: inspect shared Turret Control and the design limit. Unlocking other designs can spread the limits.</li><li>Barriers collapse quickly: compare HP research, properties and Cid’s flat reduction, rather than buying supply alone.</li><li>Support does not reach: inspect actual range and positioning. Turret range grows with research; hero support uses the relevant Special Range.</li><li>Heroes cannot survive: use armor, training and items in <a href="game-systems-td-army.html">TD Army</a>. Barrier HP research does not protect them.</li><li>Apparently enough materials but purchase unavailable: check Pristine Cores, Army EXP, the selected track’s level and NPC presence. Clout thresholds are distinct from spending requirements.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-tower-defense.html">Tower Defense</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-td-army.html">TD Army</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-td-battle-reference.html">TD Battle Reference</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-reclamation-bay.html">Reclamation Bay</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-neural-targeting.html">Neural Targeting</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-mining-system.html">Mining</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><div class="starter-lead"><p>塔防的永久升级分布在要塞各角色的菜单中。研发使用再生工坊材料与军队经验；战场临时的回收物、弹药和指挥不能支付这些费用。</p><ol><li>先到再生工坊处理回收材料，再确认军队经验余额。</li><li>按问题选菜单：补输出找 EPOM；补屏障找 Orchid；提高上限找 AIMy。</li><li>每次购买只升所选项目一级；下次进入战场才会读取新配置。</li></ol></div>
<section id="zh-menus"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Material_Recipes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Research_Costs"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Battle_Deployment_and_Starting_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>菜单位置与在场时间</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">角色与地点</th><th scope="col">当前菜单</th><th scope="col">通常在场时间</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">EPOM · 工程室</th><td data-label="当前菜单">炮塔工坊 / 手榴弹工坊</td><td data-label="通常在场时间">06:00–22:00</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">AIMy · AIMy 的控制室</th><td data-label="当前菜单">堡垒控制</td><td data-label="通常在场时间">00:00–24:00</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Orchid · 再生工坊</th><td data-label="当前菜单">屏障工坊</td><td data-label="通常在场时间">06:00–24:00</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Tinker · 工程室</th><td data-label="当前菜单">堡垒设施 / 军队护甲</td><td data-label="通常在场时间">18:00–24:00</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Anthrax · 训练厅</th><td data-label="当前菜单">队员训练 / Anthrax • 训练效率</td><td data-label="通常在场时间">08:00–18:00</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cid · 地下改造诊所</th><td data-label="当前菜单">要塞防御</td><td data-label="通常在场时间">按诊所中 Cid 的实际在场时间</td></tr></tbody></table><p>角色必须已经沿自己的路线来到这个岗位。Orchid 的《留给再生的空间》、Tinker 的工程室安排、Anthrax 的训练厅路线都不能用钟点代替。AIMy 的「堡垒控制」与 Tinker 的「堡垒设施」打开同一组四条研发。Orchid 在每三天的 12:00–18:00 有剩余物资分配中心班次，详见再生工坊指南。</p><p>以下研发、护甲、效率与设施升级本身不花游戏时间或金钱。再生工坊处理队列另需 60 分钟；请看 <a href="game-systems-reclamation-bay.html">再生工坊指南</a>，不要把处理动作与购买升级混在一起。</p></section>
<section id="zh-turrets"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Turret_Improvements"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Turret_Designs"></span><h2>EPOM：炮塔研发</h2><p>八种炮塔各自最高 10 级。蒸汽炮初始为 1 级；其余七种先支付一次解锁材料，解锁后为 1 级，再走同一套升级曲线。初次解锁不额外收军队经验。</p><details><summary>初次解锁费、战场部署费与炮塔定位</summary><p>解锁材料顺序：合金／电路／试剂／助熔剂／完好核心。战场价格顺序：回收物／弹药／指挥。这两种费用分别支付。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">炮塔</th><th scope="col">初次解锁材料</th><th scope="col">单次部署价格</th><th scope="col">定位</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">蒸汽炮</th><td data-label="初次解锁材料">0/0/0/0/0</td><td data-label="单次部署价格">40/25/12</td><td data-label="定位">通用单体火力。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">旋转机炮</th><td data-label="初次解锁材料">160/120/40/40/3</td><td data-label="单次部署价格">50/45/12</td><td data-label="定位">高速单体压制。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">铆钉炮</th><td data-label="初次解锁材料">220/80/40/20/4</td><td data-label="单次部署价格">50/32/14</td><td data-label="定位">穿透概率 20%→65%；额外命中一个目标，6 级起两个。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">等离子长矛</th><td data-label="初次解锁材料">180/220/60/140/10</td><td data-label="单次部署价格">55/45/18</td><td data-label="定位">穿透概率 30%→75%；1／5／10 级起额外命中 1／2／3 个目标。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">时空投射器</th><td data-label="初次解锁材料">80/200/80/160/8</td><td data-label="单次部署价格">50/30/20</td><td data-label="定位">连锁目标数 2→5，跳跃距离 90→135 像素。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">纳米修复信标</th><td data-label="初次解锁材料">80/160/120/80/6</td><td data-label="单次部署价格">45/20/20</td><td data-label="定位">每两战斗秒修复范围内最受损的适用建筑，恢复 6→17 生命；不会攻击或治疗英雄。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">火箭炮组</th><td data-label="初次解锁材料">200/180/160/160/12</td><td data-label="单次部署价格">65/55/22</td><td data-label="定位">爆炸半径 85→130 像素。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">废料投石机</th><td data-label="初次解锁材料">300/80/140/40/8</td><td data-label="单次部署价格">55/15/18</td><td data-label="定位">爆炸半径 105→150 像素。</td></tr></tbody></table></details><p>每级在基础威力上增加 20%，普通射程加 10 像素；命中逐步提高到 10 级的 95%。型号的穿透、连锁、修复或爆炸半径也随等级变化；生命与基础攻速不会因此一并成长。部署费用保持不变。</p><details><summary>各型号 2–10 级的全部价格</summary><details><summary>蒸汽炮</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">目标等级</th><th scope="col">合金</th><th scope="col">电路</th><th scope="col">试剂</th><th scope="col">助熔剂</th><th scope="col">完好核心</th><th scope="col">军队经验</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">2</th><td data-label="合金">36</td><td data-label="电路">18</td><td data-label="试剂">0</td><td data-label="助熔剂">6</td><td data-label="完好核心">0</td><td data-label="军队经验">150</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">3</th><td data-label="合金">60</td><td data-label="电路">30</td><td data-label="试剂">0</td><td data-label="助熔剂">10</td><td data-label="完好核心">0</td><td data-label="军队经验">300</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">4</th><td data-label="合金">96</td><td data-label="电路">48</td><td data-label="试剂">0</td><td data-label="助熔剂">16</td><td data-label="完好核心">2</td><td data-label="军队经验">600</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">5</th><td data-label="合金">150</td><td data-label="电路">75</td><td data-label="试剂">0</td><td data-label="助熔剂">25</td><td data-label="完好核心">4</td><td data-label="军队经验">1050</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">6</th><td data-label="合金">228</td><td data-label="电路">114</td><td data-label="试剂">0</td><td data-label="助熔剂">38</td><td data-label="完好核心">7</td><td data-label="军队经验">1650</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">7</th><td data-label="合金">336</td><td data-label="电路">168</td><td data-label="试剂">0</td><td data-label="助熔剂">56</td><td data-label="完好核心">11</td><td data-label="军队经验">2550</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">8</th><td data-label="合金">480</td><td data-label="电路">240</td><td data-label="试剂">0</td><td data-label="助熔剂">80</td><td data-label="完好核心">16</td><td data-label="军队经验">3750</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">9</th><td data-label="合金">660</td><td data-label="电路">330</td><td data-label="试剂">0</td><td data-label="助熔剂">110</td><td data-label="完好核心">24</td><td data-label="军队经验">5400</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">10</th><td data-label="合金">900</td><td data-label="电路">450</td><td data-label="试剂">0</td><td data-label="助熔剂">150</td><td data-label="完好核心">36</td><td data